{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09109","headline":"复理西斋寄丘员外 · 韦应物","name":"复理西斋寄丘员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"前岁理西斋，得与君子同。\n迨兹已一周，怅望临春风。\n始自疎林竹，还复长榛丛。\n端正良难久，芜秽易爲功。\n援斧开衆郁，如师啓羣蒙。\n庭宇还清旷，烦抱亦舒通。\n海隅雨雪霁，春序风景融。\n时物方如故，怀贤思无穷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09109.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09109","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}